+Use the original error and actual runtime identity first. Expected workspace/read-only denials need no repair. A TLS client failure, unsupported web content type, or nonzero process exit is not evidence of an ACL problem. Use web_download for a reference file and read_image to inspect it; webpage text belongs to web_fetch.
 
