-
-> 这个工作区被 Windows 文件权限挡住了：`<对象>` 上 `<缺哪个权限 / 哪条权限项>`。你可以把本会话切到「完全权限」(full access) 临时继续工作；切完之后既能直接干活，也可以让我继续排查这个文件权限问题（报告里已经有机制和证据）。也麻烦把这个会话作为反馈发出去，好让我们补上这个场景。
->
-> This workspace is blocked by Windows file permissions: `<object>` `<missing right / offending entry>`. Switch this session to full access (完全权限) to keep working meanwhile; then either continue your work or have me keep investigating this file-permission problem from the report. Please also send this session as feedback so we can cover the case.
-
-## Never
+An optional -Out writes a new report to an explicitly chosen directory. AllowRoot alone does not authorize or trigger a permission change. The report identifies the token under which it ran; a restricted token's denied rights do not prove that the interactive user lacks them. If the execution environment cannot start this read-only diagnosis, report that limitation and use available application diagnostics. Do not repeatedly retry the command or request full access as a way to finish the original task.
 
